	"data": "Arch Linux as Development Platform\n\nWhat It Is\ncithoreal's primary OS across 2023–2025 and beyond. Not just a distro preference — Arch represents his values: full control, no hidden processes, build it yourself, understand what you're running.\n\nEvidence in ChatGPT 2023\nAn unusually large cluster of Arch-related conversations indicates 2023 was a year of serious OS-level configuration work:\nMultiple Arch installation sessions (USB, full disk, BTRFS)\nTimeshift snapshot / BTRFS recovery\nBoot…",
